    <item>
      <title>Ysgol Gynradd Aberteifi — Magical Wings activity guide</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 10:37:50 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Authored by artist Pip Lewis&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;magical-wings---creating-layered-artworks-with-artist-piplewis&#34;&gt;Magical Wings - creating layered artworks with artist Pip Lewis&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;outline&#34;&gt;Outline&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol start=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#0-overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#1-pattern-sheet&#34;&gt;Pattern sheet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#2-photo-lottery&#34;&gt;Photo lottery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#3-tracing-outline&#34;&gt;Tracing outline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#4-adding-patterns&#34;&gt;Adding patterns&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#5-adding-detail&#34;&gt;Adding detail&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260616-aberteifi-activity-guide/#6-naming-the-species&#34;&gt;Naming the species&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;0-overview&#34;&gt;0. Overview&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This guide describes the processes involved in creating layered artworks using acetate and paper, drawing and marker art techniques. &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The art process were designed to explore and learn about the range of pattern, line and colour found on the wings of specific Butterflies and Moths species living in Oak Tree  - and the function this has on their survival.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Ysgol Gynradd Aberteifi — Project outline</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260615-aberteifi-project-outline/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 16:09:20 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260615-aberteifi-project-outline/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Authored by artist Pip Lewis&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The focus of the project in Ysgol Gynradd Aberteifi was the biodiversity to be found in an Oak tree.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We chose the Oak tree as the over-arching subject as it acts as a miniature, living ecosystems and as such presents a huge range of opportunities for the ecologist and artist to explore and devise sessions for the pupils.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I facilitated four morning art workshops worked with 23 pupils in Dosbarth Blodeuwedd — dividing the class into two groups of 12, and facilitated two morning sessions in the classroom, with each group.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>List of bird species and the Oak / Derwen</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260507-aberteifi-bird-species-list/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 07 May 2026 09:54:20 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/260507-aberteifi-bird-species-list/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This is the list of bird species that have relationship with the Oak / Derwen, that the artist Pip Lewis is working on with the Group A students.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Species&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;English name&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Welsh name&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_redstart&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phoenicurus phoenicurus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Redstart&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Tingoch&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_pied_flycatcher&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ficedula hypoleuca&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Pied Flycatcher&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Gwybedog Brith&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rook_%28bird%29&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Corvus frugilegus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Rook&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Ydfan&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_tit&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Parus major&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Great Tit&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Titw Mawr&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eurasian_blue_tit&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cyanistes caeruleus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Blue Tit&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Titw Tomos Las&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eurasian_blue_tit&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Anthus trivialis&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Tree Pipit&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Corhedydd Y Coed&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wood_warbler&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phylloscopus sibilatrix&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Wood Warbler&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Telor Y Coed&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_wood_pigeon&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Columba palumbus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Wood Pigeon&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Colomen Y Goedwig&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_starling&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sturnus vulgaris&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Starling&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Drudwy&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_owl&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Athene noctua&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Little Owl&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Tylluan Fach&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eurasian_jay&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Garrulus glandarius&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Jay&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Sgrech Y Coed&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_robin&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Erithacus rubecula&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Robin&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Robin Goch&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_spotted_woodpecker&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dendrocopos major&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Great Spotted Woodpecker&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Cnocell Fraith Fwyaf&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawfinch&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Coccothraustes coccothraustes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Hawfinch&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Gylfrinbraff&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eurasian_nuthatch&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sitta europaea&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Nuthatch&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Delor Y Cnau&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://res.cloudinary.com/naturceredigion/image/upload/v1778770101/260507-aberteifi-workshop3-acetate-robin.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Collage of Robin Goch&#34;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collage of Robin Goch, work-in-progress&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
